== Effects ==
* Adds a 33% chance for {{E|Poop}} to turn into {{E|Black Poop}}.
** This includes {{E|Red Poop}}.
* Adds a 5% chance for black poops to drop a {{E|Black Heart}} upon being destroyed.
* The chances are not affected by [[luck]].

== Synergies ==
* {{i|D12}}: Obstacles that are rerolled into poop have a greater chance of being {{E|Black Poop|n}}.
* {{p|A Card Against Humanity}} / {{t|Mysterious Candy}} / {{i|The Poop}} / [[Re-Lax|Re-Lax pill]] / {{i|Everything Jar}}'s 1st charge: Has chance for the poop created to be a {{E|Black Poop|n}}.
* {{a|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either of these effects raises the chance to 66% chance for {{E|Poop}} to turn into {{E|Black Poop}} and to 7% chance for black poops to drop a {{E|Black Heart}} upon being destroyed. Having both of them raises the chance to respectively 100% and 10%.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Hallowed Ground}}: Although {{t|Meconium}} cannot replace the poop Hallowed Ground spawns with, {{E|Black Poop}} has a chance to replace {{E|White Poop}}s that would have been created by other items which have synergies with Hallowed Ground.
* {{t|Second Hand}}: The [[confuse]] duration from {{e|Black Poop}}s is unaffected by Second Hand.

